OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's safety tops online
OL,4,Aworries, survey says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarm to children poses the greatest
OL,7,Frisk online, a survey by Guernsey's
OL,8,Fdata protection commissioner has
OL,9,Fsuggested.
OL,11,FOf those surveyed, 73% of people
OL,12,Fhighlighted concerns about online harm
OL,13,Fto children.
OL,15,FThe Office of the Data Protection
OL,16,FAuthority survey also suggested "the
OL,17,Fadoption, potential and risks of
OL,18,Fartificial intelligence is at the
OL,19,Fforefront of people's minds".
